@page "/"

<PageTitle>my blazor playground</PageTitle>

<h1>A playground with a few useful things in it</h1>
<p class="lede">A project tracker for small teams, a shared notebook for house hunting, and a handful of shared toys. Only the project tracker needs an account.</p>

<ul class="entries">
    <li>
        <a href="work">
            <strong>Work</strong>
            <span>Projects, sprints, a board and a backlog for self-organizing teams. Paste screenshots straight into descriptions and comments. Needs an account.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="homes">
            <strong>Homes</strong>
            <span>Paste links from Zillow, Redfin, Realtor.com or anywhere else, fill in details together and leave comments. Kept in the database and in your browser.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="board">
            <strong>Board</strong>
            <span>Messages for everyone, kept on your device after the server forgets them.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="postcard">
            <strong>Postcard</strong>
            <span>One long postcard with images at a time. The next one replaces it everywhere but on your device.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="canvas">
            <strong>Canvas</strong>
            <span>One black pen and one shared page, live for everyone.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="slots">
            <strong>Slots</strong>
            <span>One shared slot machine. Whoever presses first spins for everyone.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="latency">
            <strong>Latency</strong>
            <span>Time how fast public sites answer, from your browser and from this server.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="read" data-enhance-nav="false">
            <strong>Read</strong>
            <span>One plain-text article at a time, picked at random.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="about">
            <strong>About</strong>
            <span>How it works, what is kept, and who can delete what.</span>
        </a>
    </li>
</ul>
